  "Description": "Vinyl Music Player is a light and slick material-design music player for Android, forked from Phonograph. It is easy to use and customizable with multiple themes including a dark one. Users can browse and play songs from their local library, control playback (play, pause, next, previous) from a now-playing screen reachable via a bottom mini-player card, search the library, browse by folder, rescan the music library from the navigation drawer, shuffle all songs from the overflow menu, set a sleep timer, and edit track tags.",
